But with OC we got a strange volcano plot. (Second figure)
myDiff_wOD=calculateDiffMeth(meth, mc.cores=2, overdispersion = "MN")
Lots of the highly differently methylated CGs became insignificant.

Is it normal? Are false positives expected among high DMCs?
